    s__HEARTBURN_EAT(py_str("Plain, dry food sits easiest: porridge, rice, bread, bananas, melon, ginger, plain chicken or fish, and a glass of milk - little and often beats one big meal, and nothing within three hours of bed. Go steady on tomato, chilli, onion and garlic, citrus, fried and fatty food, chocolate, mint, coffee and alcohol, since those are the usual triggers. An antacid or an alginate (Gaviscon and the like) settles a bad night in minutes."));
